            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.15.25+1CH.15.26+1CH.15.27+1CH.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nyakati 15:25–28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Selemani achiaiha phamwenga atumia osi a Iziraeli na vilongozi osi a mbari za Iziraeli na akulu a mbari zao hiko Jerusalemu, ili arirehe sanduku ra chilagane ra Mwenyezi Mlungu kula Sayuni, mudzi wa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi a Iziraeli akusanyika mbere za mfalume wakati wa sikukuu ya mwezi wa sabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumia osi a Iziraeli ariphokpwedza ndipho Alawi ariunula ro sanduku ra chilagane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi aritsukula ro sanduku ra chilagane na ro hema ra mkpwutano na miyo yosi mitakatifu iriyokala mo ndani ya hema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Selemani na mkpwutano wosi wa Iziraeli ariokala akakusanyika phamwenga naye mbere za Sanduku ra Chilagane, alavya sadaka za mangʼondzi na ngʼombe nyinji zisizoolangika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha alavyadzi-sadaka achirireha phatuphe sanduku ra chilagane cha Mwenyezi Mlungu, phatuphe kpwenye chumba cha ndani cha nyumba, yani Phatu Phatakatifu Zaidi, tsini ya mapha ga makerubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala hinyo makerubi aandzula mapha gao dzulu ya phatu pha sanduku ra chilagane, aribwiningiza na mapha gao hiro sanduku ra chilagane phamwenga na migongoye ya kutsukurira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo migongo kala ni mire, hata tsaze kala inaoneka kula pho phatu phatakatifu, mbere ya cho chumba cha ndani, ela taiyaweza kuonekana kula kondze ya pho phatu phatakatifu. Migongo iyo ichere phapho hadi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 10:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mo ndani ya ro Sanduku ra Chilagane kala tamuna chitu, isiphokala vyo vipande viiri vya mawe, vyoandikpwa mumo ni Musa ko Horebu, ambako Mwenyezi Mlungu waika chilagane na atu a Iziraeli, ariphokala akatuluka Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
