              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hinyo alavyadzi-sadaka atuluka kula hipho phatu phatakatifu, (kpwani alavyadzi-sadaka osi ariokalapho kala akadzitakasa bila kujali mazuma gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona aimbadzi osi a mbari ya Lawi, yani, Asafu, Hemani, Jeduthuni, ana aho na ndugu zao kuno akavwala katani swafi na ana matoazi, vinanda na ngephephe, aima uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa wa phatu pha kulavira sadaka phamwenga na alavyadzi-sadaka gana na mirongo miiri ambao ni apigadzi tarumbeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo kala ni kazi ya hinyo apigadzi tarumbeta na aimbadzi akale anasikika chivyamwenga achitogola na kushukuru Mwenyezi Mlungu). Nao aunula sauti zao kuno anapiga tarumbeta, matoazi na vinanda kumtogola Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
